## Attribution

This repository started as a refactor of the original 17-file LangChain tutorial
in this same repo. The reference code in `final/` retains the structure and
concept coverage of the original; the teaching scaffolding (`tutorial/` task
cards, `docs/` cheatsheets, `HOW_TO_LEARN_WITH_AI.md` meta-tutorial,
`CLAUDE.md` / `.cursorrules` AI-tool integration) is new work.

Original concept coverage credit: 17 .py files in this repo's git history before
commit `8cb037a` (May 2026).

For citation in academic / blog contexts:

```
@misc{langchain_tutorial_zero,
  author = {estelledc},
  title = {LangChain Tutorial Zero — beginner-friendly LangChain/LangGraph/LangSmith
           tutorial with AI-tool-assisted learning scaffolding},
  year = {2026},
  url = {https://github.com/estelledc/langchain-langgraph-langsmith-tutorial}
}
```
